<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pillowtex raised long-term.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pillowtex raised long-term.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it raised Pillowtex Corp to a long-term buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- The brokerage said it maintained its near-term accumulate rating on Pillowtex.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
</text>
